cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  GANANA WP3 P3 - Workflows for Molecular Dynamics and Free
  energy calculations
message: >-
  Repository containing workflows and documentation for the
  GANANA WP3 - Project 3 "Framework for AI-driven
  Immunogenic Peptide Prediction". This repo contains the
  automated workflows for conformational simulations and
  free energy computations of pMHC-TCR proteins complexes
  using GROMACS and PyCOMPSs.
